<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate gains at auction.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate gains at auction.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at an auction of 91-day Lithuanian Treasury bills rose to 10.36 percent from 10.21 percent on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas unless otherwiswe stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY  AV YIELD  (LAST WEEK)  MIN/MAX  ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 91-day     10.36	10.21	10/10.66   50   84.32  50</p>
<p>Settlement date for today's auction is December 19 and the bills mature on March 20.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371-721-5240</p>
</text>
